sequenceDiagram
    actor Citizen
    participant ReactClient as React Frontend
    participant ComplaintController as ComplaintController
    participant ComplaintService as ComplaintService
    participant ComplaintRepo as ComplaintRepository
    participant Database as PostgreSQL DB

    Citizen->>ReactClient: Fills out report form & clicks Submit
    ReactClient->>ComplaintController: POST /api/complaints
    ComplaintController->>ComplaintService: createComplaint(requestDTO)
    ComplaintService->>ComplaintService: Validate SLA deadline
    ComplaintService->>ComplaintService: Set Initial Status (REPORTED)
    ComplaintService->>ComplaintRepo: save(complaintEntity)
    ComplaintRepo->>Database: INSERT INTO complaints
    Database-->>ComplaintRepo: Return saved row
    ComplaintRepo-->>ComplaintService: Return ComplaintEntity
    ComplaintService-->>ComplaintController: Return mapped DTO
    ComplaintController-->>ReactClient: 201 Created (JSON)
    ReactClient-->>Citizen: Show Success Toast & Redirect to Feed
